{"allowed_english": [], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "algebraic stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "algebraic stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "algebraic stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "表示"}, {"source_term": "algebraic stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "large", "target_term": "大量"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Stacks", "target_term": "叠"}], "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本章介绍代数叠（algebraic stacks）的若干类态射（morphisms）。\n对于具有可表（representable）对角态射（diagonal）的拟分离（quasi-separated）代数叠（algebraic stacks），可参考<REF_0001>。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n我们的目标是将代数空间（algebraic spaces）的各类态射（morphisms）的定义推广到代数叠（algebraic stacks）的态射（morphisms）。每种情形略有不同，看来最好逐一单独处理。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n对于可由代数空间（algebraic spaces）表示（representable）的代数叠（algebraic stacks）的态射（morphisms），我们已经定义了大量（large）的态射（morphisms）类型，见《叠（Stacks）的性质》第<REF_0002>节。\n对于本章中的每个相应情形，我们必须确保一般情形下的定义与那里给出的定义相容。\n\n\n\n\n", "unit_id": "tag:04XN:prose-0001", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "本章所讨论的几何对象；词表无已批准条目。", "source_term": "algebraic stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"context": "代数叠或代数空间之间的态射类型。", "source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "对角态射的可表性质。", "source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}, {"context": "代数叠的对角态射。", "source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角态射"}, {"context": "参考文献所涉及的代数叠的条件。", "source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"conte