{"allowed_english": ["fppf"], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Algebraic Stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "groupoid", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"source_term": "Descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Groupoids", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型的"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑的"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型的"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}], "translation": "由《代数叠（Algebraic Stacks）》引理<REF_0001>，我们可假设<MATH_0001>，其中所用的是代数空间（algebraic spaces）中的某个光滑（smooth）群胚（groupoid）。\n由《空间上的下降（Descent）》引理<REF_0002>，只需在<MATH_0002>上 fppf 局部地检验该性质。\n因此，我们可假设<MATH_0003>来自态射（morphisms）<MATH_0004>。由《空间中的群胚（Groupoids）》引理<REF_0003>可知，在此情形下<MATH_0005>。\n因此，只需证明<MATH_0006>是局部有限型的（locally of finite type）。这由复合（composition）<MATH_0007>是光滑的（smooth）这一事实（因而是局部有限型的（locally of finite type），见《空间的态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0004>和<REF_0005>）以及《空间的态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0006>得出。\n", "unit_id": "tag:04XR:proof", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "引用章节标题。", "source_term": "Algebraic Stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"context": "群胚所在的几何范畴。", "source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"context": "群胚的光滑性质。", "source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"context": "表示代数叠所用的群胚。", "source_term": "groupoid", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"context": "引用章节标题。", "source_term": "Descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"context": "给出对象来源的态射。", "source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "引用章节标题。", "source_term": "Groupoids", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"context": "需要证明的性质及光滑性的推论。", "source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型的"}, {"context": "用于推导局部有限型性质的复合态射。", "source_term":